1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,350
In 539 BCE,

2
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:04,850
Cyrus the Great of Persia
set his sights on Babylon.

3
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:07,250
A Babylonian chronicle records

4
00:00:07,250 --> 00:00:09,850
that his army entered the city
without a battle.

5
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:12,000
Temple rites went on,

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,850
and Cyrus proclaimed that
Babylon's own god had chosen him.

7
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,400
One of the greatest cities
of the ancient world

8
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,400
now had a new ruler.

